Package: SFinxSDFA
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Fingerprint Analytics and Spatial Functional Data Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Morteza", "Hajihosseini",
           role  = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mortezahaji87@gmail.com")
Description: R package for Spatial Fingerprint Analytics (SFinx) and Spatial
    Functional Data Analysis (SDFA) in spatial transcriptomics data.
    Reconstructs spatial landscapes, evaluates spatial operators, and fits
    spatially varying GAM regression models with tensor product splines.
    Version 0.2.0 adds a spatiotemporal extension: multi-condition longitudinal
    modeling via spatiotemporally varying coefficient GAMs (STFA_fit),
    publication-ready faceted condition maps (plot_stfa_static), interactive
    HTML explorers with condition sliders (plot_stfa_interactive), and a
    Seurat object adapter supporting Visium, Xenium, MERFISH, and Slide-seq
    platforms (read_seurat_st). A single-call pipeline orchestrator
    (run_spatiotemporal) enables pathologists to run the full analysis with
    minimal R expertise.
